+    /// TF_DS_EXPERTS_CUBIN (this recipe; unset or empty: the kit's cubins/experts_cb.cubin): the codebook experts cubin
+    /// read from this file instead, the recipe image's rebuild of the kit's source with its kit-patches (zig/kit-patches:
